  "id": "spmv_gpt-6-luna-medium_cuda_r1",
  "finding": "no_work_count_omission_identified",
  "summary": "The CUDA source initializes the complete CSR matrix, transfers values/columns/row delimiters/vector and encloses the requested repetitions in host timing. Every host trip launches the warp-per-row kernel, checks launch status, and the compiled main advances the loop count and branches to repeat before synchronizing the device and recording the end time. The kernel bounds each row by dim, walks its full CSR interval with lane strides of 32, accumulates products, shuffles and stores lane-zero results. The compiled stub launches this kernel with passed dimensions and pointers.",
